---
import HomeFlow from '../../../components/HomeFlow.astro';
import '../../../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
		<title>Hairness Diagram Lab</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main class="lab">
			<header class="lab-header">
				<div>
					<p class="kicker">Local design surface</p>
					<h1>Hairness diagram lab</h1>
				</div>
				<p>
					One system, three reading priorities. Compare the hierarchy, the
					ownership model and the compounding loop before promoting one.
				</p>
			</header>

			<section class="iteration" aria-labelledby="baseline-title">
				<div class="iteration-heading">
					<div>
						<p class="version">00 · Current baseline</p>
						<h2 id="baseline-title">Topology first</h2>
					</div>
					<p>
						Clear separation, weak story. The return loop reads like a note
						instead of the reason the system exists.
					</p>
				</div>
				<HomeFlow />
			</section>

			<section class="iteration" aria-labelledby="machine-title">
				<div class="iteration-heading">
					<div>
						<p class="version">01 · Candidate</p>
						<h2 id="machine-title">The living Home</h2>
					</div>
					<p>
						The complete topology stays visible while the Artifact → human
						curation → better Asset loop becomes part of the machine.
					</p>
				</div>

				<figure class="diagram diagram-machine" aria-labelledby="machine-caption">
					<div class="machine-grid">
						<div class="outside outside-providers">
							<p class="zone-label">Replaceable providers</p>
							<div class="chips">
								<span>Codex</span>
								<span>Claude</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="rail rail-enter" aria-hidden="true">
							<i class="packet packet-agent"></i>
						</div>

						<div class="home">
							<div class="home-title">
								<div>
									<p>Source-owned environment</p>
									<strong>Hairness Home</strong>
								</div>
								<span class="door">Front Door</span>
							</div>

							<div class="home-floor">
								<div class="room desk">
									<span>01</span>
									<strong>Desk</strong>
									<small>orients</small>
								</div>
								<div class="room assets">
									<span>02</span>
									<strong>Assets <i>v2</i></strong>
									<small>equips</small>
								</div>
								<div class="room artifacts">
									<span>04</span>
									<strong>Artifacts</strong>
									<small>retain evidence</small>
								</div>
								<div class="room curator">
									<span>05</span>
									<strong>Human curation</strong>
									<small>selects what compounds</small>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="inner-loop" aria-label="Curated compounding loop">
								<span>Artifact</span>
								<i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
								<span>Human judgment</span>
								<i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
								<span>Better Asset</span>
								<b class="packet packet-return" aria-hidden="true"></b>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="rail rail-binding" aria-hidden="true">
							<span>Binding</span>
							<i class="packet packet-work"></i>
						</div>

						<div class="outside outside-targets">
							<p class="zone-label">Independent Targets</p>
							<div class="target-stack">
								<span>Application</span>
								<span>API</span>
								<span>Documentation</span>
							</div>
							<small>code · history · delivery</small>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="return-rail" aria-hidden="true">
						<span>work returns as an Artifact</span>
						<i class="packet packet-artifact"></i>
					</div>

					<figcaption id="machine-caption">
						Agents come and go. Targets stay independent. The Home retains
						what human judgment chooses to make reusable.
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</section>

			<section class="iteration" aria-labelledby="loop-title">
				<div class="iteration-heading">
					<div>
						<p class="version">02 · Candidate</p>
						<h2 id="loop-title">The compounding loop</h2>
					</div>
					<p>
						The value story dominates: each pass through a Target can leave
						the next agent better equipped.
					</p>
				</div>

				<figure class="diagram diagram-loop" aria-labelledby="loop-caption">
					<div class="loop-stage">
						<div class="loop-entry">
							<p class="zone-label">Any provider</p>
							<div class="chips">
								<span>Codex</span>
								<span>Claude</span>
							</div>
							<i aria-hidden="true">↓</i>
						</div>

						<div class="loop-home">
							<div class="loop-home-title">
								<p>Hairness Home</p>
								<strong>Own the learning loop.</strong>
							</div>

							<ol class="cycle">
								<li class="cycle-step step-desk">
									<span>1</span>
									<div><strong>Desk</strong><small>Orient</small></div>
								</li>
								<li class="cycle-step step-assets">
									<span>2</span>
									<div><strong>Assets</strong><small>Equip</small></div>
								</li>
								<li class="cycle-step step-target">
									<span>3</span>
									<div><strong>Target</strong><small>Work through a Binding</small></div>
								</li>
								<li class="cycle-step step-artifact">
									<span>4</span>
									<div><strong>Artifact</strong><small>Return evidence</small></div>
								</li>
								<li class="cycle-step step-human">
									<span>5</span>
									<div><strong>Human</strong><small>Curate</small></div>
								</li>
							</ol>

							<div class="capital">
								<span>Owned agentic capital</span>
								<strong>Assets get better, not just bigger.</strong>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<figcaption id="loop-caption">
						The provider supplies the agent. The Target supplies the work.
						The Home owns what can improve the next pass.
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</section>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	:global(body) {
		background:
			linear-gradient(rgba(244, 239, 229, 0.96), rgba(244, 239, 229, 0.96)),
			repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 47px, rgba(23, 25, 22, 0.06) 48px);
	}

	.lab {
		width: min(1480px, calc(100% - 2rem));
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem) 0 8rem;
	}

	.lab-header,
	.iteration-heading {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(280px, 0.8fr);
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: end;
	}

	.lab-header {
		padding-bottom: 4rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
	}

	.lab-header h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem);
	}

	.lab-header > p,
	.iteration-heading > p {
		max-width: 48rem;
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--muted);
	}

	.kicker,
	.version,
	.zone-label {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		color: var(--copper-dark);
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 850;
		letter-spacing: 0.13em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.iteration {
		padding: 5rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
	}

	.iteration-heading h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);
	}

	.diagram {
		position: relative;
		margin: 3rem 0 0;
		padding: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
		border-radius: 2rem;
		background: rgba(255, 250, 240, 0.86);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
	}

	.machine-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(140px, 0.7fr) 72px minmax(480px, 2.5fr) 90px minmax(160px, 0.85fr);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.outside {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 1rem;
		background: var(--paper-strong);
	}

	.chips,
	.target-stack {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.chips span,
	.target-stack span {
		padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 0.6rem;
		background: white;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 760;
	}

	.target-stack span {
		box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--sand);
	}

	.outside small {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.67rem;
	}

	.rail {
		position: relative;
		height: 2px;
		background: var(--line-strong);
	}

	.rail::after {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: -4px;
		right: 0;
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;
		border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
		border-right: 2px solid var(--ink);
		transform: rotate(45deg);
	}

	.rail-binding span {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0.8rem;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.62rem;
		font-weight: 850;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.home {
		position: relative;
		padding: 1.25rem;
		border-radius: 1.35rem;
		background: var(--night);
		color: var(--cream);
		box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(28, 34, 33, 0.28);
	}

	.home-title {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.25rem 1.1rem;
	}

	.home-title p,
	.home-title strong {
		display: block;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.home-title p {
		color: var(--sand);
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: 0.09em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.home-title strong {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
	}

	.door {
		padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--copper);
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		font-weight: 850;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.home-floor {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
		gap: 0.6rem;
	}

	.room {
		min-height: 116px;
		padding: 0.8rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(249, 246, 239, 0.16);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		background: rgba(249, 246, 239, 0.06);
	}

	.room > span {
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 1.65rem;
		color: var(--sand);
		font: 700 0.65rem "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
	}

	.room strong,
	.room small {
		display: block;
	}

	.room strong {
		font-size: 0.78rem;
	}

	.room strong i {
		color: var(--sand);
		font-style: normal;
	}

	.room small {
		color: rgba(249, 246, 239, 0.55);
		font-size: 0.65rem;
	}

	.curator {
		border-color: rgba(227, 195, 159, 0.48);
		background: rgba(183, 91, 54, 0.17);
	}

	.inner-loop {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		margin-top: 0.7rem;
		padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(249, 246, 239, 0.14);
		border-radius: 999px;
		color: rgba(249, 246, 239, 0.68);
		font-size: 0.67rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.inner-loop i {
		color: var(--sand);
		font-style: normal;
	}

	.return-rail {
		position: relative;
		width: 70%;
		height: 2.2rem;
		margin: 1.4rem 8% 0 auto;
		border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
		border-top: 0;
		border-radius: 0 0 999px 999px;
	}

	.return-rail::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: -5px;
		left: -1px;
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;
		border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
		border-left: 2px solid var(--ink);
		transform: rotate(45deg);
	}

	.return-rail span {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0.55rem;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		padding-inline: 0.55rem;
		background: var(--paper-strong);
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		font-weight: 750;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.packet {
		position: absolute;
		z-index: 2;
		width: 9px;
		height: 9px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--copper);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(183, 91, 54, 0.15);
	}

	.packet-agent {
		top: -4px;
		left: 0;
		animation: enter 7s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	.packet-work {
		top: -4px;
		left: 0;
		animation: enter 7s 2s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	.packet-artifact {
		top: -4px;
		right: 0;
		border-radius: 2px;
		background: var(--sky-dark);
		animation: return 7s 3.7s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	.packet-return {
		top: calc(50% - 4px);
		left: 24%;
		width: 7px;
		height: 7px;
		animation: compound 7s 5.4s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	.diagram figcaption {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		padding-top: 1rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.loop-stage {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 180px minmax(520px, 1fr);
		gap: 2rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.loop-entry {
		text-align: center;
	}

	.loop-entry i {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		color: var(--copper);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-style: normal;
	}

	.loop-home {
		position: relative;
		min-height: 480px;
		padding: 2rem;
		overflow: hidden;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle, rgba(183, 91, 54, 0.14) 0 25%, transparent 26%),
			var(--night);
		color: var(--cream);
		box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(28, 34, 33, 0.25);
	}

	.loop-home-title {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		left: 50%;
		z-index: 2;
		width: 210px;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.loop-home-title p {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		color: var(--sand);
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 850;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.loop-home-title strong {
		display: block;
		font-size: 1.55rem;
		line-height: 1.05;
	}

	.cycle {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 1.5rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		animation: halo 7s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	.cycle::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		inset: 13%;
		border: 1px dashed rgba(227, 195, 159, 0.42);
		border-radius: 50%;
	}

	.cycle-step {
		position: absolute;
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.55rem;
		align-items: center;
		min-width: 145px;
		padding: 0.65rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(249, 246, 239, 0.18);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		background: #252c2b;
	}

	.cycle-step > span {
		display: grid;
		flex: 0 0 1.65rem;
		height: 1.65rem;
		place-items: center;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--copper);
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		font-weight: 850;
	}

	.cycle-step strong,
	.cycle-step small {
		display: block;
	}

	.cycle-step strong {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
	}

	.cycle-step small {
		color: rgba(249, 246, 239, 0.58);
		font-size: 0.62rem;
	}

	.step-desk {
		top: 0;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
	}

	.step-assets {
		top: 25%;
		right: 0;
	}

	.step-target {
		right: 8%;
		bottom: 3%;
	}

	.step-artifact {
		bottom: 3%;
		left: 8%;
	}

	.step-human {
		top: 25%;
		left: 0;
	}

	.capital {
		position: absolute;
		right: 2rem;
		bottom: 45%;
		display: none;
	}

	@keyframes enter {
		0%, 8% { left: 0; opacity: 0; }
		14% { opacity: 1; }
		34% { left: calc(100% - 9px); opacity: 1; }
		42%, 100% { left: calc(100% - 9px); opacity: 0; }
	}

	@keyframes return {
		0%, 8% { right: 0; opacity: 0; }
		14% { opacity: 1; }
		34% { right: calc(100% - 9px); opacity: 1; }
		42%, 100% { right: calc(100% - 9px); opacity: 0; }
	}

	@keyframes compound {
		0%, 8% { left: 24%; opacity: 0; }
		14% { opacity: 1; }
		34% { left: 78%; opacity: 1; }
		42%, 100% { left: 78%; opacity: 0; }
	}

	@keyframes halo {
		0%, 68%, 100% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0 transparent); }
		76%, 88% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 16px rgba(183, 91, 54, 0.28)); }
	}

	@media (max-width: 980px) {
		.machine-grid,
		.loop-stage {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 0.8rem;
		}

		.rail {
			width: 2px;
			height: 42px;
			margin-inline: auto;
		}

		.rail::after {
			top: auto;
			right: -4px;
			bottom: 0;
			transform: rotate(135deg);
		}

		.rail-binding span {
			top: 50%;
			left: 1rem;
			transform: translateY(-50%);
		}

		.packet-agent,
		.packet-work {
			top: 0;
			left: -4px;
			animation-name: enterVertical;
		}

		.return-rail {
			display: none;
		}

		.loop-entry i {
			margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		}

		.loop-home {
			border-radius: 2rem;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.lab-header,
		.iteration-heading {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.25rem;
		}

		.home-floor {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		}

		.inner-loop {
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			border-radius: 0.75rem;
		}

		.loop-home {
			display: grid;
			min-height: auto;
			gap: 1rem;
			padding: 1rem;
			background: var(--night);
		}

		.loop-home-title,
		.cycle,
		.cycle-step {
			position: static;
			width: auto;
			transform: none;
		}

		.loop-home-title {
			padding: 1rem;
			text-align: left;
		}

		.cycle {
			display: grid;
			gap: 0.5rem;
			animation: none;
		}

		.cycle::before {
			display: none;
		}

		.cycle-step {
			min-width: 0;
		}
	}

	@keyframes enterVertical {
		0%, 8% { top: 0; opacity: 0; }
		14% { opacity: 1; }
		34% { top: calc(100% - 9px); opacity: 1; }
		42%, 100% { top: calc(100% - 9px); opacity: 0; }
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.packet,
		.cycle {
			animation: none;
		}

		.packet {
			display: none;
		}
	}
</style>
